/**
\page api_type_shapevertex SHAPEVERTEX

A vertex proxy returned by `shape.getVertex(index)`. It refers to the indexed vertex in its owning `VMSHAPE`; it is not a detached value.

| Property | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `x` | number | Vertex x position. |
| `y` | number | Vertex y position. |
| `u` | number | Texture u coordinate. |
| `v` | number | Texture v coordinate. |

Reading or writing these properties accesses the owning shape's arrays. Use the proxy while its shape remains alive.

*/
